flowchart TD
  START([Agent Start]) --> INTENT{Task Intent}
  INTENT -->|coding| LOCAL[Select local]
  INTENT -->|integration| DEV[Select dev]
  INTENT -->|release| STAGE[Select stage]
  INTENT -->|production-ops| PROD[Select prod]
  INTENT -->|unknown| FAIL_INTENT[Block: unknown intent]

  LOCAL --> SWITCH[Run use-env]
  DEV --> SWITCH
  STAGE --> SWITCH
  PROD --> SWITCH

  SWITCH --> PREFLIGHT[Run preflight]
  PREFLIGHT --> OK{Pass?}
  OK -->|Yes| PASS([Return PASS status])
  OK -->|No| RETRY{Retry available?}
  RETRY -->|Yes| PREFLIGHT2[Run preflight once]
  PREFLIGHT2 --> OK2{Pass?}
  OK2 -->|Yes| PASS
  OK2 -->|No| BLOCK([Block + Escalate])
  RETRY -->|No| BLOCK

  FAIL_INTENT --> BLOCK
